window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Betrayal has a bitter taste. It needs to be sweetened with a heavy dose of revenge.</p> <p>Before he was the Host, he was just a man in unrequited love, trying to keep his promises.</p> <p>Raven isn't done escaping death. She isn't done with this country. She isn't done with this game. And she isn't done with doing what she does best.</p> <p>Being underestimated.</p> <p>The game isn't over, but as it nears the end she starts to fully question.</p> <p>Why are the winners never seen again?</p> <p>Why is the Host so familiar?</p> <p>And what exactly does 197 want from her?</p>"; 
